   "id": "pmt/pure-core-1/ch7/q7",
   "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad\\mathbf Q=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>Describe fully the single geometrical transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\"></span>.</li><li>Describe fully the single geometrical transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q\"></span>.</li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol><p>The transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> followed by the transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\"></span> is the transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span>, which is represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf R\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"2\"><li>Determine <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf R\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>Evaluate the determinant of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf R\"></span>.</li><li>Explain how the value obtained in (c)(i) relates to the transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span>.</li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
