   "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-1\\\\4&amp;3\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;6\\\\11&amp;-8\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^{-1}\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>The transformation represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf B\"></span> followed by the transformation represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\"></span> is equivalent to the transformation represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"2\"><li>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf B\"></span>, giving your answer in its simplest form. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
