   "id": "pmt/pure-core-1/ch7/q10",
   "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-\\sqrt3\\\\\\sqrt3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\"></span> is non-singular. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>The hexagon <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span> is transformed to the hexagon <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"S\"></span> by the transformation represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\"></span>.</p><p>Given that the area of hexagon <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span> is 5 square units,</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"2\"><li>find the area of hexagon <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"S\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol><p>The matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\"></span> represents an enlargement, with centre (0, 0) and scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;0\"></span>, followed by a rotation anti-clockwise through an angle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta\"></span> about (0, 0).</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"3\"><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
